      "key": { "provision_id": "B97" },
      "field": "rule",
      "proposed": "DIRECTORY:DIR_MODULE_LINE_COUNT_REGISTRY sole roster;LANGUAGE-CODES:C|CPP|CSHARP|FSHARP|GO|RUST|JAVASCRIPT;RETIRED:Python/Node sources are non-conforming and counted as boundary violations,not canonical language codes;RECORD-KINDS:SOURCE_UNIT+ARCHITECTURE_MODULE_SUMMARY;SOURCE_UNIT:one canonical authored physical source file;LIMITS:500 per source unit+300 per class/type+50 per callable/query;XINGCHENG-EXCLUSION:the complete Xingcheng native domain,including its modules,source files,classes,types,functions,callables,declarations,public entry points,model,training,inference,learning,evaluation,data processing and internal tools,is excluded from every line-count and declaration-count limit;the exclusion does not waive correctness,security,authority,data-residency,performance,resource-bound,reviewability or native-language requirements;JAVASCRIPT:counts imports+exports+declarations+functions+classes+JSX+JSDoc-associated source while comment-only lines remain excluded;NORMALIZATION:registered encoding+LF+remove blank-only and parser-proven comment-only lines;FRESHNESS:inventory/language/ownership change invalidates evidence;RELEASE:full roster parity required\n\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
